{#
The shared report/widget header, rendered for a full-page report. `enriched` decides whether the
title carries the help icon, inline help and rate-feature widget - a report shown without a
content block card never had them.

Every attribute is emitted unconditionally, even when empty, because
piwikHelper.compileVueEntryComponents builds the component's template from the attributes present
at compile time: an attribute missing here could not be updated later either, and dataTable.js
pushes the new title and documentation into this app when a related report is loaded.
#}
{% set isEnriched = enriched|default(false) %}
{% set lastUpdated = reportLastUpdatedMessage is defined ? reportLastUpdatedMessage : '' %}
<div vue-entry="CoreHome.ReportHeader"
     context="fullPage"
     heading-level="h2"
     report-title="{{ properties.title|json_encode }}"
     feature-name="{{ (isEnriched ? properties.title : '')|json_encode }}"
     inline-help="{{ (isEnriched ? properties.documentation|default('') : '')|json_encode }}"
     help-url="{{ (isEnriched ? properties.onlineGuideUrl|default('')|safelink : '')|json_encode }}"
     report-generated="{{ (isEnriched ? lastUpdated : '')|json_encode }}"
     edit-url="{{ (isEnriched ? properties.title_edit_entity_url|default('') : '')|json_encode }}"
></div>
